WEBVTT

00:00:01.056 --> 00:00:10.256
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:21.266
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:30.746
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.256 --> 00:00:37.216
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.326 --> 00:00:39.256
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:43.556
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.296 --> 00:00:48.426
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.836 --> 00:00:52.636
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.306 --> 00:01:00.306
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:08.986
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.856 --> 00:01:15.986
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.196 --> 00:01:21.466
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.566 --> 00:01:24.626
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.946 --> 00:01:40.546
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:40.656 --> 00:01:44.176
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:44.286 --> 00:01:46.956
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:02:08.286 --> 00:02:10.686
In search of the last
remaining Rune-God...

00:02:10.786 --> 00:02:15.316
...Hikaru and company fought against
Inouva, Zagato's right-hand man.

00:02:15.526 --> 00:02:18.186
Inouva himself
pleaded with Zagato...

00:02:18.296 --> 00:02:23.196
...and returned to his creature form
in order to defeat the three girls.

00:02:23.296 --> 00:02:28.566
But he fell to the combined strength
of the girls, who were aided by Ferio.

00:02:29.106 --> 00:02:32.436
And Ferio learned
a new truth of his own.

00:02:32.936 --> 00:02:37.346
That he was Princess
Emeraude's younger brother.

00:02:37.876 --> 00:02:43.816
The Last Rune-God:
Rayearth, Lord of Fire

00:02:47.286 --> 00:02:48.686
Lord Zagato!

00:02:49.326 --> 00:02:50.486
Lord Zagato!

00:02:51.656 --> 00:02:53.926
Where in the world are you?

00:02:54.696 --> 00:02:55.786
Zagato...

00:02:57.666 --> 00:02:58.826
Zagato...

00:03:00.966 --> 00:03:01.996
Please...

00:03:02.106 --> 00:03:05.696
Please stop, Zagato.
Stop fighting like this...

00:03:06.076 --> 00:03:07.806
With Inouva's defeat...

00:03:07.906 --> 00:03:11.136
...only one person can
now defeat the Magic Knights.

00:03:12.176 --> 00:03:14.876
You can't mean that you,
Zagato, are going to...

00:03:15.116 --> 00:03:18.316
I am positive I will win.

00:03:20.986 --> 00:03:22.416
Emeraude...

00:03:26.926 --> 00:03:28.056
Zagato...

00:03:29.296 --> 00:03:30.726
Wait, Zagato!

00:03:30.826 --> 00:03:32.766
Zagato, please stop!

00:03:34.136 --> 00:03:36.036
At this rate, this world...

00:03:36.136 --> 00:03:39.436
Cephiro will really fall to ruin!

00:03:41.746 --> 00:03:42.936
Zagato!

00:03:49.746 --> 00:03:51.186
Lord Zagato...

00:03:51.586 --> 00:03:52.556
Why?

00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:55.986
If you want to rule this land...

00:03:56.086 --> 00:03:59.526
...all you have to do
is control Princess Emeraude.

00:04:00.326 --> 00:04:02.656
The princess is
the Pillar of this world...

00:04:02.766 --> 00:04:05.736
...and Cephiro
is a mirror of her heart.

00:04:07.296 --> 00:04:09.566
Why do you not threaten her?

00:04:10.006 --> 00:04:13.126
Why do you merely
keep her imprisoned?

00:04:23.546 --> 00:04:24.516
Mokona!

00:04:24.616 --> 00:04:25.946
Mokona!

00:04:29.626 --> 00:04:31.386
Mokona went in!

00:04:31.496 --> 00:04:32.926
That Mokona...

00:04:33.026 --> 00:04:36.116
Where in the world is Mokona
trying to take us now?

00:04:36.726 --> 00:04:39.456
Probably to where
the third Rune-God lies.

00:04:39.566 --> 00:04:42.826
The last Rune-God?
In a cave like this?

00:04:44.106 --> 00:04:47.036
However, I feel like
monsters are going to appear.

00:04:47.776 --> 00:04:50.006
I feel that way too.

00:04:50.106 --> 00:04:53.876
You didn't have to say it out loud.
It makes it harder to go in...

00:04:53.976 --> 00:04:55.206
One more.

00:04:55.316 --> 00:04:59.876
If we revive the last Rune-God,
we'll become Magic Knights!

00:05:00.486 --> 00:05:01.546
Yeah.

00:05:04.386 --> 00:05:06.326
Umi, Fuu, let's go!

00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:17.696
It's the exit!

00:05:17.806 --> 00:05:19.536
Wait, Hikaru!

00:05:29.146 --> 00:05:30.406
It's hot...

00:05:31.916 --> 00:05:34.016
A volcano shrine.

00:05:34.486 --> 00:05:36.316
It's here, Hikaru.

00:05:36.426 --> 00:05:38.686
The third Rune-God is here.

00:05:40.426 --> 00:05:44.156
When we were first summoned
to Cephiro from Tokyo Tower...

00:05:44.266 --> 00:05:48.356
...we saw the ocean, the mountain
in the sky, and the volcano.

00:05:48.466 --> 00:05:51.696
Each of them hid
one Rune-God each.

00:05:52.136 --> 00:05:55.626
Thanks, Mokona,
for bringing us here.

00:05:57.976 --> 00:05:59.566
Not bad, Mokona.

00:06:00.046 --> 00:06:02.476
Thank you very much, Sir Mokona.

00:06:08.356 --> 00:06:10.486
You didn't help out with battles...

00:06:10.586 --> 00:06:13.926
...but by bringing us
to where the Rune-Gods were...

00:06:14.026 --> 00:06:17.056
...Mokona helped us
as best as possible.

00:06:17.996 --> 00:06:19.326
Thanks, Mokona.

00:06:19.436 --> 00:06:24.136
I'm jumping ahead, but when
we revive the Rune-God here...

00:06:24.876 --> 00:06:27.806
...we have to face that
villain Zagato next, right?

00:06:29.076 --> 00:06:31.836
You know where
he is, of course, right?

00:06:34.016 --> 00:06:35.846
You do know, right?

00:06:37.616 --> 00:06:38.706
Mokona!

00:06:50.496 --> 00:06:51.466
Mokona!

00:06:56.436 --> 00:06:57.166
Ms. Hikaru!

00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:58.106
Ms. Hikaru!
Hikaru!

00:07:12.856 --> 00:07:13.976
Ms. Hikaru!

00:07:14.456 --> 00:07:15.716
Hikaru!

00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:24.856
Ms. Hikaru! Ms. Hikaru!

00:07:25.136 --> 00:07:28.066
Hikaru! Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:07:29.306 --> 00:07:30.066
Ms. Hikaru...

00:07:30.066 --> 00:07:32.336
Ms. Hikaru...
Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:07:34.436 --> 00:07:36.906
I've been waiting
for you, Magic Knights.

00:07:43.386 --> 00:07:44.406
Zagato!

00:08:14.946 --> 00:08:16.376
What is this?

00:08:16.846 --> 00:08:18.946
It feels like something's here.

00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:30.126
A mane of flames?

00:08:30.866 --> 00:08:32.126
Red eyes...

00:08:32.536 --> 00:08:33.926
A lion?

00:08:34.036 --> 00:08:35.626
Or a wolf?

00:08:41.136 --> 00:08:42.866
What is...

00:08:43.946 --> 00:08:45.306
...thy name?

00:08:46.516 --> 00:08:47.536
Hikaru.

00:08:48.276 --> 00:08:50.216
Hikaru Shidou.

00:08:52.016 --> 00:08:53.956
My name is Rayearth.

00:08:55.156 --> 00:08:59.316
A legendary Rune-God
that awaits the Magic Knight...

00:08:59.426 --> 00:09:04.656
...in this Fire Shrine over the ages.

00:09:06.866 --> 00:09:08.056
Rune-God?

00:09:08.906 --> 00:09:10.456
A legendary Rune-God?

00:09:12.576 --> 00:09:17.436
Girl summoned here from another
world by the Pillar of Cephiro...

00:09:18.576 --> 00:09:23.606
Dost thou wish to become
a true Magic Knight?

00:09:25.586 --> 00:09:26.646
I do.

00:09:27.116 --> 00:09:30.746
I want to become
a Magic Knight and save Cephiro.

00:09:30.856 --> 00:09:35.586
I want to grant the wishes of all
the people who helped us here.

00:09:35.696 --> 00:09:38.956
I want all three of us
to become Magic Knights together!

00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:48.306
Then show before me the proof that
makes thee worthy of donning me.

00:09:50.806 --> 00:09:55.336
Show before me
the strength of thine heart...

00:09:55.446 --> 00:09:59.856
...that makes thee worthy of donning
me and becoming a Magic Knight.

00:10:00.786 --> 00:10:03.046
The strength of my heart?

00:10:03.686 --> 00:10:06.526
Show me proof of
the strength of thine heart...

00:10:06.626 --> 00:10:10.186
...that makes thee worthy
of becoming a Magic Knight.

00:10:24.876 --> 00:10:26.746
Umi! Fuu! What happened?

00:10:26.846 --> 00:10:28.076
Hang on!

00:10:28.176 --> 00:10:30.706
Their armor is gone...
Their gloves too...

00:10:32.156 --> 00:10:33.246
You're...

00:10:33.486 --> 00:10:35.286
I am Zagato.

00:10:35.386 --> 00:10:36.586
Zagato?

00:10:37.386 --> 00:10:41.826
You have defeated my servants,
revived two Rune-Gods...

00:10:42.296 --> 00:10:45.386
...and have arrived
at the last Rune-God.

00:10:45.996 --> 00:10:48.596
But this will be the end of you.

00:10:49.836 --> 00:10:52.466
You controlled Ascot,
Caldina, and even Lafarga...

00:10:52.576 --> 00:10:55.436
...the captain
of Princess Emeraude's guards.

00:10:55.546 --> 00:10:56.766
You'll pay...

00:10:57.106 --> 00:10:59.546
Why did you abduct
Princess Emeraude?

00:10:59.946 --> 00:11:03.276
She's a very important
person in Cephiro!

00:11:04.046 --> 00:11:06.346
Princess Emeraude
will not be returned.

00:11:06.456 --> 00:11:08.746
Nor this land, Cephiro.

00:11:09.086 --> 00:11:10.526
What was that?

00:11:18.296 --> 00:11:22.466
What do you mean, Zagato? Don't
you care what happens to Cephiro?

00:11:22.566 --> 00:11:26.366
I do not.
There is only one thing I wish for.

00:11:26.776 --> 00:11:31.076
Princess Emeraude and everyone in
Cephiro are suffering because of you!

00:11:32.976 --> 00:11:34.566
Umi! Fuu!

00:11:44.026 --> 00:11:48.426
Magic Knight,
it is impossible for you to defeat me.

00:11:51.836 --> 00:11:53.856
T-The armor...

00:11:55.066 --> 00:11:58.056
You are too weak
to shield your friends.

00:11:58.166 --> 00:12:00.696
I will protect them.

00:12:01.076 --> 00:12:03.596
The three of us
will become Magic Knights.

00:12:03.706 --> 00:12:07.306
Unfortunately, this is
the end for you, Magic Knight.

00:12:09.686 --> 00:12:10.736
Die.

00:12:24.466 --> 00:12:25.586
Why?

00:12:32.806 --> 00:12:34.276
Lafarga...

00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:59.696
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:13:03.166 --> 00:13:08.536
It appears you have been released
from my mind-control spell, Lafarga.

00:13:08.646 --> 00:13:11.706
Cephiro belongs
to Princess Emeraude.

00:13:11.806 --> 00:13:13.936
It does not belong to you.

00:13:14.416 --> 00:13:16.076
High Priest Zagato...

00:13:16.186 --> 00:13:20.046
...I will defeat you as captain
of Princess Emeraude's guards.

00:13:22.226 --> 00:13:24.586
You cannot win against me.

00:13:24.986 --> 00:13:27.326
Perhaps not, but neither can you.

00:13:38.206 --> 00:13:39.696
Damn you, Zagato!

00:13:41.946 --> 00:13:44.966
Lafarga can't even scratch him...

00:13:49.886 --> 00:13:50.976
Don't move.

00:13:56.856 --> 00:13:59.986
Your sword will not work against me.

00:14:03.926 --> 00:14:05.696
Lafarga, look out!

00:14:10.166 --> 00:14:11.326
Lafarga!

00:14:18.716 --> 00:14:21.476
Lafarga...
You shouldn't move, Lafarga.

00:14:23.786 --> 00:14:27.306
Z-Zagato, the match is still...

00:14:33.226 --> 00:14:36.956
Being assigned the important duty
of protecting Princess Emeraude...

00:14:37.066 --> 00:14:41.526
You defeated me once, but I cannot
allow you to defeat me twice.

00:14:41.636 --> 00:14:42.506
Lafarga...

00:14:42.506 --> 00:14:43.466
Lafarga...
Zagato!

00:14:45.406 --> 00:14:50.706
I will grant your wish of
not making a fool of yourself.

00:14:53.946 --> 00:14:55.346
Magic Knight...

00:14:55.446 --> 00:14:59.816
You, a human with no armor,
are going to protect Lafarga?

00:15:01.216 --> 00:15:02.586
I told you.

00:15:02.686 --> 00:15:05.626
That it would be
impossible for you to win.

00:15:06.296 --> 00:15:08.956
If you give up and back away...

00:15:09.066 --> 00:15:12.496
...I can send you back to your world.

00:15:13.036 --> 00:15:16.196
Leave this battle or die.

00:15:17.506 --> 00:15:21.406
Girl summoned
to Cephiro from another world...

00:15:23.276 --> 00:15:27.146
Show before me the proof...

00:15:27.846 --> 00:15:32.176
The proof that makes
thee worthy of donning me.

00:15:33.486 --> 00:15:34.616
That voice...

00:15:36.626 --> 00:15:41.326
Show before me the strength of
thine heart that makes thee worthy...

00:15:41.426 --> 00:15:45.596
...of donning me and
becoming a true Magic Knight.

00:15:47.636 --> 00:15:49.536
Strength of my heart!

00:15:50.106 --> 00:15:54.736
I will only say this once more. If you
back away now, I will spare your life.

00:15:55.136 --> 00:15:56.236
I...

00:15:56.406 --> 00:15:58.346
I won't run away!

00:15:59.216 --> 00:16:00.306
Magic Knight...

00:16:00.416 --> 00:16:02.646
If I run away from here now...

00:16:02.746 --> 00:16:07.186
...what happens to the hearts and
wishes of all those who helped us?

00:16:07.716 --> 00:16:12.246
What happens to the hearts of my
friends, who've fought this far with me?

00:16:14.526 --> 00:16:18.296
I made a promise to Clef
and Presea and Ferio!

00:16:18.666 --> 00:16:21.826
I promised all the people
I met here in Cephiro!

00:16:22.206 --> 00:16:25.326
That I'd become
a Magic Knight and save Cephiro!

00:16:26.136 --> 00:16:30.076
I'm going to keep my promise. I'm
going to rescue Princess Emeraude.

00:16:30.176 --> 00:16:34.946
I'll save Cephiro, and my friends
and I will return to Tokyo together!

00:16:35.046 --> 00:16:36.246
Hikaru...

00:16:36.546 --> 00:16:38.706
So I can't lose to the likes of you!

00:16:38.816 --> 00:16:40.906
Then only death awaits you.

00:16:49.296 --> 00:16:50.356
Lafarga!

00:16:56.866 --> 00:16:58.666
Lafarga... Lafarga...

00:16:58.766 --> 00:17:00.636
Lafarga! Lafarga!

00:17:01.476 --> 00:17:02.596
Ms. Hikaru...

00:17:03.076 --> 00:17:05.066
Now no one will shield you.

00:17:05.376 --> 00:17:07.776
I won't let you hurt anyone else!

00:17:08.176 --> 00:17:10.276
I'm going to keep my promise!

00:17:10.386 --> 00:17:14.316
I'm going to keep the promise
I made to everyone and to myself!

00:17:22.096 --> 00:17:23.186
I won't...

00:17:23.666 --> 00:17:25.786
I won't lose!

00:17:26.436 --> 00:17:28.766
Ms. Hikaru, run! Ms. Hikaru!

00:17:28.866 --> 00:17:30.336
Stop, Hikaru!

00:17:30.436 --> 00:17:32.026
I won't lose!

00:17:32.136 --> 00:17:33.466
Magic Knight...

00:17:34.206 --> 00:17:37.196
What pushes you onward...

00:17:37.706 --> 00:17:39.196
A promise?

00:17:40.146 --> 00:17:43.306
I will honor
the strength of your heart...

00:17:43.416 --> 00:17:46.646
...and send you to your
grave with my greatest spell.

00:17:49.256 --> 00:17:52.056
Stop!

00:17:59.096 --> 00:18:00.156
Flames?

00:18:01.436 --> 00:18:02.866
Who is it?

00:18:07.976 --> 00:18:09.136
Rayearth...

00:18:10.306 --> 00:18:12.606
Legendary Magic Knight...

00:18:13.416 --> 00:18:17.176
I have seen proof of the strength
of thine heart that cares...

00:18:17.286 --> 00:18:21.656
...for thy friends and others,
and that remains firm in thy beliefs.

00:18:41.576 --> 00:18:43.436
That's new armor...

00:18:55.256 --> 00:18:57.016
The third Rune-God...

00:19:24.016 --> 00:19:26.606
Rune-God... This is a Rune-God.

00:19:26.716 --> 00:19:29.516
I was finally able
to revive a Rune-God!

00:19:30.986 --> 00:19:33.926
Umi! Fuu! The third Rune-God...

00:19:40.096 --> 00:19:41.586
Umi... Fuu...

00:19:59.716 --> 00:20:01.986
Now we have all three.

00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:09.086
Girls summoned from another
world by the Pillar of Cephiro...

00:20:09.896 --> 00:20:14.796
Now is the time to don us
and become true Magic Knights.

00:20:23.806 --> 00:20:25.336
Rayearth!

00:20:34.716 --> 00:20:35.946
Selece!

00:20:44.126 --> 00:20:45.396
Windam!

00:20:47.896 --> 00:20:50.336
Is this the inside of a Rune-God?

00:20:52.436 --> 00:20:55.406
This is what they meant
by donning a Rune-God?

00:20:55.506 --> 00:20:58.966
Were we able to become
real Magic Knights?

00:21:01.246 --> 00:21:02.076
Mokona!

00:21:02.146 --> 00:21:02.886
Mokona!

00:21:02.886 --> 00:21:04.346
Mokona!
Sir Mokona!

00:21:09.126 --> 00:21:11.286
Lafarga... Thank goodness.

00:21:12.126 --> 00:21:13.716
I am all right.

00:21:13.826 --> 00:21:18.486
Legendary Magic Knights, save
Princess Emeraude and Cephiro.

00:21:19.666 --> 00:21:22.426
But where in the world
is Princess Emeraude?

00:21:24.406 --> 00:21:27.336
I am sure Princess
Emeraude meant to guide us...

00:21:27.436 --> 00:21:30.306
...with this magic item
that Ferio gave us.

00:21:30.406 --> 00:21:31.376
Let's go.

00:21:31.446 --> 00:21:33.066
Umi! Fuu!

00:21:33.176 --> 00:21:35.506
To where Princess Emeraude awaits!

00:21:51.696 --> 00:21:55.296
Magic Knights, I leave
Princess Emeraude in your hands!

00:22:26.796 --> 00:22:31.206
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.776 --> 00:22:38.366
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.816 --> 00:22:45.376
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.116 --> 00:22:49.956
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.256 --> 00:22:55.416
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.626 --> 00:22:58.066
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.166 --> 00:23:02.966
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:04.006 --> 00:23:10.636
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.376 --> 00:23:16.646
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.016 --> 00:23:23.816
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.326 --> 00:23:29.756
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:45.546 --> 00:23:49.206
Magic Knight Rayearth
is finally at its climax!

00:23:49.316 --> 00:23:52.716
And so, next time,
we listened to your requests...

00:23:52.816 --> 00:23:54.906
...and bring you a one-hour special!

00:23:55.016 --> 00:23:58.386
From the big battle with Zagato
to the first season ending...

00:23:58.486 --> 00:24:00.086
...all in one shot!

00:24:00.196 --> 00:24:02.486
The Magic Knight Rayearth special!

00:24:02.596 --> 00:24:06.186
It's really amazing!
A truly exciting doubleheader!

00:24:06.296 --> 00:24:09.166
Monday, March 13th,
for 60 minutes starting at 7 PM!

00:24:09.166 --> 00:24:10.536
Showdown!
The Magic Knights Versus Zagato
Monday, March 13th,
for 60 minutes starting at 7 PM!

00:24:10.536 --> 00:24:12.406
Showdown!
The Magic Knights Versus Zagato
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.406 --> 00:24:13.406
Showdown!
